"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"medium","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0227"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004","quote":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天《宋史》，未及成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《宋書》旣行，子野更刪撰爲《宋略》二十卷。其敘事評論多善，約見而歎曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛、北地傅昭、汝南周捨咸稱重之。至是，吏部尚書徐勉言之於高祖，以爲著作郎，掌國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直正員郎，著作、舍人如故。又敕掌中書詔誥。是時西北徼外有白題及滑國，遣使由岷山道入貢。此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔《注》云：『白題，胡名也。』又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰《方國使圖》，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至于海表，凡二十國。"}],"rationale":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null},{"id":"d-nanshi033-服虔","person_id":"rxm_wwu_6ns","surfaces":["服虔"],"scope":"same_chapter","status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"medium","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0050"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019","quote":"時西北遠邊有白題及滑國遣使由岷山道入貢，此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔注云：'白題，胡名也。'又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰方國使圖，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至於海表，凡二十國。子野與沛國劉顯、南陽劉之遴、陳郡殷芸、陳留阮孝緒、吳郡顧協、京兆韋棱皆博學，深相賞好，顯尤推重之。時吳平侯蕭勱、范陽張纘每討論墳籍，咸折衷於子野。"}],"rationale":"白題胡名也的注者服虔，梁030同一引漢書注字句、同作者，不由單姓任配。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004","text":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天《宋史》，未及成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《宋書》旣行，子野更刪撰爲《宋略》二十卷。其敘事評論多善，約見而歎曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛、北地傅昭、汝南周捨咸稱重之。至是，吏部尚書徐勉言之於高祖，以爲著作郎，掌國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直正員郎，著作、舍人如故。又敕掌中書詔誥。是時西北徼外有白題及滑國，遣使由岷山道入貢。此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔《注》云：『白題，胡名也。』又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰《方國使圖》，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至于海表，凡二十國。","source_position":{"start":1016,"end":1322,"raw":"　　初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天《宋史》，未及成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《[[宋書]]》旣行，子野更刪撰爲《宋略》二十卷。其敘事評論多善，約見而歎曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛、北地傅昭、汝南周捨咸稱重之。至是，吏部尚書徐勉言之於高祖，以爲著作郎，掌國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直正員郎，著作、舍人如故。又敕掌中書詔誥。是時西北徼外有白題及滑國，遣使由岷山道入貢。此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔《注》云：『白題，胡名也。』又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰《方國使圖》，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至于海表，凡二十國。","raw_path":"sources/liangshu/wikisource-1508510-raw.wikitext"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋064原傳松之中書侍郎與注陳壽三國志、梁曾祖松之明字官爵及宋053議禮同人脈絡。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"何承天","kind":"person","person_id":"92h_l93_ixy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"沈約","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"約","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"蕭琛","kind":"person","person_id":"m5h_0x9_uxb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"傅昭","kind":"person","person_id":"jmo_mhy_5mr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"周捨","kind":"person","person_id":"tyk_15n_8t3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁廷太子詹事，與南史周舍同事件；不套漢文周舍或趙簡子周舍。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"徐勉","kind":"person","person_id":"r9i_hp1_yo6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"整篇梁廷高祖；與宋064高祖不是同人，採作品和本傳事件上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0215","start":215,"end":219,"surface":"漢潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"現有史記095p029與此引文同斬胡白題將事件，可回溯灌嬰本傳，不只依爵名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0220","start":220,"end":224,"surface":"胡白題將","kind":"person","person_id":"3ul_r7s_sou","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"引用漢事的一位將領；不當白題國，也不把白題解為已確定個人諱。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"服虔","kind":"person","person_id":"rxm_wwu_6ns","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0244","start":244,"end":248,"surface":"漢定遠侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"後漢047明班超封定遠侯，後漢088八滑擊北虜事件之將卻為班勇；銜/事件衝突未解，不任連班超、不造第三人。","candidate_person_ids":[]},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0251","start":251,"end":253,"surface":"八滑","kind":"person","person_id":"h8q_tj4_cxf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"後漢088明勇率加特奴及八滑、八滑為後部親漢侯，同一擊北虜事件；梁之滑國後裔僅推測，不能建祖系。"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510"},{"text":"時西北遠邊有白題及滑國遣使由岷山道入貢，此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔注云：'白題，胡名也。'又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰方國使圖，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至於海表，凡二十國。子野與沛國劉顯、南陽劉之遴、陳郡殷芸、陳留阮孝緒、吳郡顧協、京兆韋棱皆博學，深相賞好，顯尤推重之。時吳平侯蕭勱、范陽張纘每討論墳籍，咸折衷於子野。","source_position":{"start":10762,"end":10954,"raw":"時西北遠邊有白題及滑國遣使由岷山道入貢，此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔注云：'白題，胡名也。'又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰方國使圖，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至於海表，凡二十國。子野與沛國劉顯、南陽劉之遴、陳郡殷芸、陳留阮孝緒、吳郡顧協、京兆韋棱皆博學，深相賞好，顯尤推重之。時吳平侯蕭勱、范陽張纘每討論墳籍，咸折衷於子野。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0038","start":38,"end":42,"surface":"漢潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"白題斬將的漢潁陰侯，梁030同一白題引古已用灌嬰身份，並保漢初潁陰侯的原稱；不是新授爵事件。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0044","start":44,"end":49,"surface":"白題將一人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"漢潁陰侯所斬一名未名胡將；個人可分而無名，保原稱未決，不據白題族名造具名人物。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"服虔","kind":"person","person_id":"rxm_wwu_6ns","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"白題胡名也的注者服虔，梁030同一引漢書注字句、同作者，不由單姓任配。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0065","start":65,"end":69,"surface":"漢定遠侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"引文不足唯一定位：保留未決候選，不配新人物。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"之","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"原文明示此稱謂，但本次不足唯一定位；保留未決，不新增臆測身份。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"劉顯","kind":"person","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沛國劉顯與子野交好且推師道，梁030同地望、同交遊名列及顯推重短稱。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"劉之遴","kind":"person","person_id":"q7n_s7f_1cs","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"南陽劉之遴先在交遊列、後鴻臚卿觀移魏文，梁030同地望、同官、同文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"殷芸","kind":"person","person_id":"8d4_fth_d4l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"陳郡殷芸與子野賞好的博學名列，梁030同地望、同友人序列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0140","start":140,"end":143,"surface":"阮孝緒","kind":"person","person_id":"372_tla_k26","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"陳留阮孝緒與子野博學賞好，梁030同地望、同友人列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"顧協","kind":"person","person_id":"jc6_fqx_h6v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吳郡顧協與子野博學賞好，梁030同地望、同友人列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"韋棱","kind":"person","person_id":"g1o_tw1_xj8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"京兆韋棱在劉顯至顧協的交遊人列末，梁030同地望、同人列與子野交遊脈絡。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0162","start":162,"end":163,"surface":"顯","kind":"person","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沛國劉顯與子野交好且推師道，梁030同地望、同交遊名列及顯推重短稱。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0166","start":166,"end":167,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"蕭勱","kind":"person","person_id":"ik4_l58_n7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吳平侯蕭勱與張纘折衷墳籍於子野，梁030同爵、同對談人物和文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"張纘","kind":"person","person_id":"wec_66y_sxi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"范陽張纘與吳平侯蕭勱討論墳籍於子野，梁030同地望、同伴及事件。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0189","start":189,"end":191,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510","source":{"title":"梁書/卷30","revision_id":1508510,"revision_timestamp":"2018-10-23T11:04:54Z","status":200,"response_sha256":"a0c2fde0d659c9579a74194db70540c89ea4ff8160f8761aecdeeeec25530db4","raw_sha256":"930b640ef553931a6d0f2c2b8c548fbd69e0f0db12dd6637222764518d1b871f","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7